sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Seed as Seed Input
    participant Telemetry as Telemetry Sources
    participant Intel as Threat Intel
    participant Alpha as Alpha Dispatcher
    participant Bus as Event Bus
    participant Policy as Policy Guardrails
    participant Tracker as Tracker Agent
    participant Flanker as Flanker Agent
    participant Closer as Closer Agent
    participant Scribe as Scribe Agent
    participant CaseMem as Shared Case Memory
    participant Ledger as Evidence Ledger
    participant LearnQ as Learning Queue
    participant Analyst as Analyst Review

    Seed->>Alpha: Open hunt from IOC / alert / anomaly
    Alpha->>Bus: Publish initial hunt task
    Alpha->>CaseMem: Create case record
    Alpha->>Ledger: Start immutable timeline

    Bus->>Tracker: Assign initial scent task
    activate Tracker
    Tracker->>Telemetry: Query primary signals
    Telemetry-->>Tracker: Alert context / raw events
    Tracker->>Intel: Enrich IOC / TTP context
    Intel-->>Tracker: Matches / confidence hints
    Tracker->>CaseMem: Store initial hypothesis
    Tracker->>Ledger: Log evidence + first scent
    Tracker->>Bus: Publish findings
    deactivate Tracker

    Bus->>Flanker: Assign lateral pivot task
    activate Flanker
    Flanker->>Telemetry: Pivot across related hosts / users / DNS / email
    Telemetry-->>Flanker: Adjacent entities + behaviors
    Flanker->>CaseMem: Store related pivots
    Flanker->>Ledger: Log pivot evidence

    alt Flanker finds a meaningful side signal
        Flanker->>CaseMem: Create fresh branch hypothesis
        Flanker->>Bus: Publish branch update for dispatcher
        Bus->>Alpha: Notify branch elevation
        Alpha->>Bus: Dispatch follow-up branch tasks
    else No meaningful branch
        Flanker->>Bus: Publish lateral findings only
    end
    deactivate Flanker

    Bus->>Closer: Assemble decision packet
    activate Closer
    Closer->>CaseMem: Read case state + branch context
    Closer->>Intel: Pull final threat context if needed
    Intel-->>Closer: Supporting intel
    Closer->>Ledger: Log verdict rationale
    Closer->>Analyst: Submit verdict + next-best action
    deactivate Closer

    par Continuous logging
        Tracker->>Scribe: Forward hunt events
        Flanker->>Scribe: Forward pivot events
        Closer->>Scribe: Forward verdict events
        Scribe->>Ledger: Append immutable log entries
        Scribe->>CaseMem: Update factual case timeline only
    and Policy check
        Policy-->>Analyst: Show approval boundaries
    end

    alt Analyst approves learning update
        Analyst->>LearnQ: Approve lessons / dead ends / reusable playbook notes
        LearnQ->>CaseMem: Store approved learning only
    else Analyst denies learning update
        Analyst-->>CaseMem: No memory update
    end

    alt Continue hunt
        Analyst->>Alpha: Continue hunt with new tasks
        Alpha->>Bus: Dispatch next round
    else Escalate / close
        Analyst->>Ledger: Record final case outcome
    end

    Note over Alpha,Bus: Alpha is a dispatcher with light arbitration, not a heavy supervisor.
    Note over Scribe,Ledger: Scribe logs facts only&#59; post-hunt analysis stays out of V1.